msgstr "Connecté"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:95
msgid "Enter a name for the account"
msgstr "Saisissez un nom pour le compte"

#. TRANSLATORS: the address example stays as it is.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:97
msgid "Enter the server's address, such as http://localhost:11434/v1"
msgstr "Saisissez l’adresse du serveur, par exemple http://localhost:11434/v1"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:98 ui/internal/jira/wizard.go:161
#: ui/internal/jira/wizard.go:414 ui/internal/crm/text.go:457
#: ui/internal/crm/text.go:564
msgid "This is not a web address"
msgstr "Ce n’est pas une adresse web"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:99
msgid "A certificate can be pinned only for an https address"
msgstr "Un certificat ne peut être épinglé que pour une adresse https"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:100
msgid "Enter the API key"
msgstr "Saisissez la clé d’API"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:101
msgid "Enter or choose a model"
msgstr "Saisissez ou choisissez un modèle"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:102
msgid "This is not a model id"
msgstr "Ce n’est pas un identifiant de modèle"

#. TRANSLATORS: Save of the AI provider dialog with the consent check box off.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:104
msgid "Allow sending mail to the provider first"
msgstr "Autorisez d’abord l’envoi du courrier au fournisseur"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:106
msgid "The provider could not be reached"
msgstr "Impossible de joindre le fournisseur"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:107
msgid "The provider did not answer in time"
msgstr "Le fournisseur n’a pas répondu à temps"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:108
msgid "The connection to the provider is not secure"
msgstr "La connexion au fournisseur n’est pas sécurisée"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:109
msgid "The provider answered with an error"
msgstr "Le fournisseur a répondu par une erreur"

#. TRANSLATORS: status of the AI provider dialog after a test; %d is the number of models the provider listed.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:120
#, c-format
msgid "Connected · %d model"
msgid_plural "Connected · %d models"
msgstr[0] "Connecté · %d modèle"
msgstr[1] "Connecté · %d modèles"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the host of an OpenAI-compatible server reached over plain http.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:127
#, c-format
msgid "The API key and your mail travel unencrypted over http to %s."
msgstr "La clé d’API et votre courrier transitent sans chiffrement via http vers %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: under the address field of an OpenAI-compatible server; the examples follow, one per line.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:154
msgid "The server's base URL, usually ending in /v1. For example:"
msgstr "L’URL de base du serveur, qui se termine généralement par /v1. Par exemple :"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:181
msgid "The assistant sends the prompt, the text you write, the mail it reads for you and that mail's attachments to the provider. It can read mail and prepare drafts; it cannot send, delete or move messages."
msgstr "L’assistant envoie au fournisseur la requête, le texte que vous écrivez, le courrier qu’il lit pour vous et les pièces jointes de ce courrier. Il peut lire le courrier et préparer des brouillons ; il ne peut pas envoyer, supprimer ni déplacer de messages."

#. TRANSLATORS: check box of the AI provider dialog; Save needs it on.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:183
msgid "Allow Malachi Mail to send mail to this provider"
msgstr "Autoriser Malachi Mail à envoyer du courrier à ce fournisseur"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:187
msgid "Send Mail to Anthropic?"
msgstr "Envoyer le courrier à Anthropic ?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:188
msgid "They go to Anthropic under its API terms, which do not use data sent through the API for training by default."
msgstr "Ils sont transmis à Anthropic selon ses conditions d’API, qui par défaut n’utilisent pas les données envoyées via l’API pour l’entraînement."

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:190 ui/internal/assistant/chatgpt.go:58
msgid "Send Mail to OpenAI?"
msgstr "Envoyer le courrier à OpenAI ?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:191
msgid "They go to OpenAI under its API terms, which do not use data sent through the API for training by default."
msgstr "Ils sont transmis à OpenAI selon ses conditions d’API, qui par défaut n’utilisent pas les données envoyées via l’API pour l’entraînement."

#. TRANSLATORS: consent heading of an OpenAI-compatible server the user set the address of.
#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:194
msgid "Send Mail to Your Server?"
msgstr "Envoyer le courrier à votre serveur ?"

#: ui/internal/aiaccount/text.go:195
msgid "They go to the server at the address you set. Over http they travel unencrypted."
msgstr "Ils sont transmis au serveur à l’adresse que vous avez indiquée. Via http, ils circulent sans chiffrement."

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: the Anthropic Messages API with the user's own key.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:188
msgid "Anthropic API"
msgstr "API Anthropic"

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: the OpenAI API with the user's own key.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:190
msgid "OpenAI API"
msgstr "API OpenAI"

#. TRANSLATORS: the kind of an AI provider account: any server with the OpenAI chat completions interface (Ollama, llama.cpp, LM Studio, vLLM, a gateway).
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:192
msgid "OpenAI-compatible server"
msgstr "Serveur compatible OpenAI"

#. TRANSLATORS: row of Settings → AI: which provider the assistant in the app runs on (Claude Code, ChatGPT, or an AI provider account).
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:196
msgid "Assistant Uses"
msgstr "L’assistant utilise"

#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:197
msgid "Claude Code or ChatGPT on this computer, or an AI provider added in Integrations"
msgstr "Claude Code ou ChatGPT sur cet ordinateur, ou un fournisseur d’IA ajouté dans Intégrations"

#. TRANSLATORS: why an AI provider account cannot be chosen: its switch in Integrations is off.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:199
msgid "Switched off in Integrations"
msgstr "Désactivé dans Intégrations"

#. TRANSLATORS: why an AI provider account cannot be chosen: the user did not allow sending mail to it yet.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:201
msgid "Sending mail to it is not allowed yet"
msgstr "L’envoi de courrier vers ce fournisseur n’est pas encore autorisé"

#. TRANSLATORS: why an AI provider account cannot be chosen: the provider refused its API key.
#: ui/internal/assistant/api.go:203
msgid "The provider refused the API key"
